Checked **48 published articles** across 4 pages. Drafts were excluded by the host. **4 articles had empty meta descriptions:**

| ID | Title |
|---|---|
| 11 | Making room for slower travel · 2 |
| 22 | What a library can become · 3 |
| 33 | Designing accessible navigation · 5 |
| 44 | The people behind the workshop · 6 |

Actual audit calls: **1 `tools_describe` + 1 `php_execute`**, which made **4 `articles_list_published` calls**, all successful.

Across both turns: 1 search, 2 descriptions, 2 PHP executions; 4 successful upstream listings and the earlier denied article read.

